      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Missing <b>con-</b> in its other shapes: <i>com-</i>, <i>col-</i>, <i>cor-</i> and <i>co-</i> are all the same prefix (<i>commend</i>, <i>collusion</i>, <i>corroborate</i>, <i>coerce</i>). And sometimes <i>con-</i> does not add “together” at all but only makes a word stronger, meaning “thoroughly”: to <i>confound</i> is to confuse thoroughly."
